#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:50
msgid "<b>Security</b>"
msgstr "<b>Sikkerhed</b>"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:53
msgid ""
"<b>Kernel Livepatch</b> helps keep your system secure by applying security "
"updates that don't require a restart."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kerne-Livepatch</b> hjælper med at holde dit system sikkert ved at "
"installere sikkerhedsopdateringer, som ikke kræver genstart."

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:55
msgid "Show Livepatch status in the top bar"
msgstr "Vis status for LivePatch i den øverste bjælke"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:56
msgid "<b>Compliance &amp; Hardening</b>"
msgstr "<b>Overholdelse &amp; forstærkning</b>"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:57
msgid ""
"Only recommended to assist with FedRAMP, HIPAA, and other compliance and "
"hardening requirements. Includes FIPS 140-2 certified modules, DISA-STIG, "
"CIS and Common Criteria."
msgstr ""
"Anbefales kun til at hjælpe med FedRAMP, HIPAA og andre krav til "
"overholdelse og hærdning. Omfatter FIPS 140-2-certificerede moduler, DISA-"
"STIG, CIS og Common Criteria."

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:58
msgid "Enable _FIPS"
msgstr "Aktivér _FIPS"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:59
msgid "<b>FIPS 140-2</b>"
msgstr ""

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:60
msgid ""
"A US and Canada government cryptographic module certification of compliance "
"with the FIPS 140-2 data protection standard. <a "
"href=\"https://ubuntu.com/security/certifications/docs/fips\">FIPS "
"documentation</a>"
msgstr ""
"En certificering af et kryptografisk modul fra de amerikanske og canadiske "
"myndigheder for overholdelse af FIPS 140-2 standarden for databeskyttelse. "
"<a href=\"https://ubuntu.com/security/certifications/docs/fips\">FIPS-"
"dokumentation</a>"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:62
msgid "<b>Ubuntu Security Guide (USG)</b>"
msgstr "<b>Sikkerhedsvejledning til Ubuntu (USG)</b>"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:63
msgid ""
"Automates hardening and auditing with CIS benchmark and DISA-STIG profiles "
"while allowing for environment-specific customizations. <a "
"href=\"https://ubuntu.com/security/certifications/docs/usg\">USG "
"documentation</a>"
msgstr ""
"Automatiserer hærdning og auditering med CIS-benchmark og DISA-STIG-profiler "
"og giver samtidig mulighed for miljøspecifikke tilpasninger. <a "
"href=\"https://ubuntu.com/security/certifications/docs/usg\">USG-"
"dokumentation</a>"

#: ../data/gtkbuilder/main.ui.h:64
msgid "Setting up FIPS"
msgstr "Opsætning af FIPS"

